        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, top left",
          "value": "<p></p>\n\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Let it be registered in the Bureau of Tax Accounting,</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">if God wills.</p>\n</li>\n\n\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">It has been registered, and the amount is one d\u012bn\u0101r</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">exactly.</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Praise be to God with the praise of those who give thanks.</p>\n</li></ol>\n\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 2
    },
    {
      "etag": "\"2f8ebe777bb7023dbc8269e95457ea3c\"",
      "id": "https://geniza.princeton.edu/annotations/b4a47888-c7f7-4183-8f7d-b98816ff72c0/",
      "type": "Annotation",
      "created": "2026-09-03T17:34:31.957975+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-09-17T14:57:15.837522+00:00",
      "dc:source": "https://geniza.princeton.edu/sources/135/",
      "target": {
        "source": {
          "id": "https://cudl.lib.cam.ac.uk/iiif/MS-TS-AR-00034-00089/canvas/1",
          "type": "Canvas",
          "partOf": {
            "id": "https://geniza.princeton.edu/documents/16243/iiif/manifest/"
          }
        },
        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:466.79986572265625,234.32244873046875,891.1016235351562,814.1613159179688",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "<p><i>Registration mark on left</i></p>\n\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">Let it be registered in the office of accounts</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">if God wills.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">They have registered the amount of three, a half and a sixteenth.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Praise be to God, with the praise of those who give thanks.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">In the name of God, the merciful and compassionate.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">A valid receipt has been granted to the tax-farmer of \u1e0e\u0101t al-\u1e62af\u0101 on behalf of \u02beAb\u016b al-\u1e24asan ibn Wahb, the estate-manager,\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">for the year four-hundred and two, under the supervision of the auspicious,\u00a0rightly-guided judge, \u1e6eiqat al-Mulk Mak\u012bn al-Dawla\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">wa-\u02beAm\u012bnuha, the prot\u00e9g\u00e9 of the commander of the faithful, \u02beAb\u016b al-\u1e24asan \u02bfAl\u012b ibn Bah\u0101r, and in the presence of the trusted judge\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\u02beAb\u016b \u02bfAl\u012b al-\u1e24asan ibn Ya\u1e25y\u0101 ibn Bah\u0101r,\u00a0his deputy, with the elder</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Sad\u012bd al-Dawla \u02beAb\u016b al-Faraj \u02bfAbd al-Mas\u012b\u1e25 ibn Q\u016br\u012bl acting as accountant.</li>\n<li>Half of this: One, a half and a quarter. Its amount: Three, a half and a sixteenth.</li>\n<li>Written by M\u012b\u1e35\u0101\u02be\u012bl ibn \u02bfAbd al-Mas\u012b\u1e25, the cashier. Valid. The third of the month\u00a0of Rama\u1e0d\u0101n,</li>\n<li>in the year four-hundred and two.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 2
    },
